<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Monoprix  distributes dividend.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Monoprix  distributes dividend.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's main retail stores firm SNMVT-Monoprix said it had started distributing a 1.2 dinar dividend on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>The firm made a net profit of 4.88 million dinars in 1996, slightly up from 4.79 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>Turnover was 43.21 million dinars in 1996.</p>
<p>Privately-owned Monoprix is listed at the Tunis Stock Exchange since last year when it sold to the public a 10 percent stake in its capital which is now at 24.565 million dinars. ($=1.0957 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
